@proxyUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@bffUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Configure the REST Client extension to use @proxyUrl before sending these requests.
# VS Code setting: rest-client.http.proxy = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Exercise 1: request interception and parameter tampering
POST {{bffUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Original Name",
  "email": "original@example.com",
  "phone": "+66800000001"
}

### Exercise 2: OTP request; add Mock-Scenario in Burp Intercept
POST {{bffUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+66800000001",
  "code": "123456"
}

